<title>FINLAND: Silja 1996 loss/shr narrows to FIM 9.74.</title>
<headline>Silja 1996 loss/shr narrows to FIM 9.74.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss per share (markka)			 9.74 vs 21.11 loss</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		     nil vs nil</p>
<p> Loss after financial items		     133 vs 389 loss</p>
<p> Gross revenues				   3,978 vs 3,777</p>
<p> Operating profit				   110 vs 88 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Finnish passenger ferry operator Silja Oy Ab on February 12 announced a preliminary 133 million markka loss after financial items.</p>
</text>
